{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_014hid_1_5_014_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_01:1_5_014_01:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_01:1_5_014_01:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_01:1_5_014_01:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_01:1_5_014_01:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a036fca08ed473eca9e92f1b9c6ec340d0b1ce7c5b64b9e8c9a7c2349e2079e",
      "text": "松饼预拌粉广告拍摄的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_01:1_5_014_01:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:543b5a14473f3e032edd4b274e224ee5e94e8e698aa45059f5cfbfbbf5e9e05b",
      "text": "英雄先生。今天总觉得您比平时还要\n干劲十足呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_01:1_5_014_01:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afd6b844cafae5436dd085f9245d7ec87a1e761e6c0112c56014daf5887e9971",
      "text": "哈哈哈，看得出来吗？\n不过也是，心情可能确实有点小雀跃吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_01:1_5_014_01:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fae152dae04a0c7559c01fbab944c5a1765b540df20d3c5bb2e01299040936d4",
      "text": "毕竟是翘首以盼的松饼广告拍摄嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_01:1_5_014_01:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efe30e6dee21ac16010a23cbed4c0d7d26def29481181c5a478af31045101db3",
      "text": "果然碰上自己喜欢的东西，就会比平时\n更加有冲劲呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_01:1_5_014_01:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b6449ef1dd9d2e2dc2b3631146aafa8a84e68978e3829852c78c2a6f652802d",
      "text": "虽说无论什么工作我都会全力以赴，\n但倾注的感情越深，干劲自然也就越足了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_01:1_5_014_01:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97bf7ed5cf226aa38b17a80354281e0ed71d83599858cc75a5ef64dc438bba6a",
      "text": "和紧张又不太一样的心跳加速……雀跃？\n这种感觉其实挺舒服的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_01:1_5_014_01:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9252af3997dc5c49ec311ebf2106784cdf1f7c2a7bc87faeba62104b969fab1f",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー也会有产生这种心情的时候吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_01:1_5_014_01:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb0ec62409fc59d4b908c614fc6cfec3c0a1a221e8bb403f01c5556ab952b994",
      "text": "看到大家开开心心地工作时，\n我就会产生这种心情哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_01:1_5_014_01:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d0404e9957508d098dbbe3c67394820de9bbbfb759726ba2bb890c6c120b920",
      "text": "哈哈。听你这么一说，\n我可就越来越来劲了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_01:1_5_014_01:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bd2166a74ffe82f98c48ed101357fbaee9e01e5923763dd1bbd9a9a192e5774",
      "text": "我要做出最棒的松饼，\n让拍摄用的那些样品都相形见绌！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
